  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Data2X program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data2X, an alliance housed at the U.N. Foundation, seeks to improve the quality, availability, and use of gender data to make a practical difference in the lives of women and girls. Data2X works with partners to improve the production and use of gender data through advocacy, collaboration, communications, and research. During this grant period, Data2X will work toward ensuring that gender data guides smart policymaking and promotes accountability in the effort to improve the lives of women and girls in countries around the world. This will include improving investment in gender data systems, improving the usability of gender data for policy, catalyzing policy demand for gender data, and creating an enabling environment for gender data use. (Strategy: International Women&#x2019;s Economic Empowerment)</narrative>
  </description>
